.DS_Store
# The whole local restore point. Three scratch files reached main through it,
# including a copy of ApiIntegrationTest.java that was already stale by the
# time it landed -- a second copy of a test file drifts from the real one and
# misleads whoever reads it next.
backups/

# Gate reports are the output of a run, not repository content. Five of these
# were committed, recording denominators measured on a polluted working tree,
# and ci/check-floors.sh reads them with no freshness check -- so it could be
# run against checked-in artifacts and report five gates checked with no run
# having happened. delivery-gates gitignores this directory for the same reason.
.gate-reports/
